        "solution_text": "$18 \\times 50$\n$=9 \\times 2 \\times 50$\n$=9 \\times 100$\n$=900$"
      },
      {
        "question_text": "Use $48=6 \\times 8$ to calculate $48 \\times 125$ mentally.",
